<content><![CDATA[<media-image source="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/haxtheweb/art/main/haxtheweb/hax-morph/media/hax-morph.gif" alt="Pixel text reads HAX, then breaks apart into rainbow pixel blocks, scanline tears and streams of ones and zeros with rpg-characters flashing through the static, rebuilding as Headless Authoring Experience, back to HAX, then Human, Agent, Experience, with the H, A and X lit in teal."></media-image>
